# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/worker/Dockerfile (11.operations.md).
# Env files never enter an image: the host's secret store supplies them.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.claude
.superpowers
docs
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
supabase/seed.sql
# The dashboard deploys to Vercel and the print agent runs on the counter computer.
# Their manifests stay so `bun install --frozen-lockfile` sees every workspace.
apps/dashboard/**
!apps/dashboard/package.json
apps/print-agent/**
!apps/print-agent/package.json
packages/ui/**
!packages/ui/package.json
**/.DS_Store
